          "message": {
            "text": "The 16-entry audit found this claim itself was wrong: /export-frame is available in normal scrubber mode and is exercised that way by the server E2E. Only POST /ticket is review-gated. The corrected entry now cites both the exact 404 assertion and an explicitly headless two-drag browser sequence that proves drawing remains armed.",
            "markdown": "The 16-entry audit found this claim itself was wrong: `/export-frame` is available in normal scrubber mode and is exercised that way by the server E2E. Only `POST /ticket` is review-gated. The corrected entry now cites both the exact 404 assertion and an explicitly headless two-drag browser sequence that proves drawing remains armed."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tests/feature-coverage.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 610,
                  "endLine": 619,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    id: \"bin.svg-scrubber\",\n    behavior: \"Animated-SVG timeline bench (play/scrub/trim/export-frame) + --review issue reporter (STATEFUL: review mode).\",\n    doc: \"docs/82-svg-scrubber-review-mode.md\",\n    verbs: [\"svg-scrubber\"],\n    tests: [\"src/scrubber/trim.test.ts\", \"src/scrubber/crop.test.ts\", \"src/scrubber/ticket.test.ts\", \"src/scrubber/server.validation.test.ts\", \"src/scrubber/server.e2e.test.ts\"],\n    transition: \"POST /ticket is review-only (404 unless --review); after review mode is armed, the region overlay stays armed across multiple drags.\",\n    transitionEvidence: [\n      { test: \"src/scrubber/ticket.test.ts\", title: \"404s when review mode is not enabled\" },\n      { test: \"src/scrubber/server.e2e.test.ts\", title: \"supports keyboard file entry and keeps region drawing armed across repeated drags (DM-2599)\" },\n    ],"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
